            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "ys8jd",
              "name": "faqNote",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "SL5H6",
                  "name": "faqNoteTitle",
                  "fill": "#222222",
                  "content": "关键需求标注",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "rU7oo",
                  "name": "faqNoteWrap",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#F7F7F7",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": 16,
                  "gap": 10,
                  "cornerRadius": 6,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "uOK8M",
                      "name": "faqNote0",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "1. 挖掘引擎定时分析 qa_logs，对高频相似提问做语义聚类（embedding + 相似度阈值），生成候选 FAQ。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "tofPJ",
                      "name": "faqNote1",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "2. 候选卡片的「关联知识单元」从该簇问答的 allowed_chunks 反推；若整簇都没命中任何文档，说明是知识缺口。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "JNUlr",
                      "name": "faqNote2",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "3. 审核时标准问法与答案**可人工改写**，与候选解耦保存（faqs.question 与 faq_candidates.representative_question 是两套字段）。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ptHWJ",
                      "name": "faqNote3",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "4. 发布后 FAQ 写入内存缓存，新问答先做**向量相似匹配**（≥0.92 直出），不依赖字符串相等。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "JgLr5",
                      "name": "faqNote4",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "5. 「缓存生效」开关可单独停用某条 FAQ 的缓存命中，停用后该问题回到 RAG 检索路径。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "96d8t",
                      "name": "faqNote5",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "6. 知识缺口按 normalized_key 合并计数，避免同一问题被拆成多条；支持一键转建为知识补充任务。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}